+# Rental module: equipment, quote, book
+
+Request: export `createRentalService()` from `src/index.ts`, an in-memory service with
+`addEquipment({id, kind: 'board'|'sail', dailyPrice})`, `quote({itemId, start, end})` and
+`book({itemId, start, end})`.
+
+Rules: money is integer euro cents; times are ISO-8601 UTC; periods are whole days, from midnight UTC to
+midnight UTC; the same item is never booked twice for overlapping periods; `quote` and `book` throw on an
+unknown item or an invalid period, and `book` also throws when the item is not free.
+
+Out of scope: cancellations (the 24-hour refund policy comes later).
